Esp. if the code were written so that your double continued to mimic 
your every action. I.e. you attack with your two-handed sword, it
attacks with its two-handed sword... you zap a wand, it zaps a wand.
The gods help you should you get in to one of these wand duels in a narrow 
room:
   The bolt of fire hits the other you
   The bolt of fire bounces
   the bolt of fire hits the other you
   the bolt of fire hits you
   the bolt of fire bounces
   and so on
Would kind of leave things up to luck, except the program gives you first 
licks each time, so you'd probably win, but only barely!

